  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Integral approach to build resilience in communities vulnerable to food insecurity and climatic shocks, especially droughts in Guatemala (PRO RESILIENCE)&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
